"description":"Study smarter with AI, your AI-powered learning companion designed to help you understand concepts, complete assignments, and improve your academic skills. Whether you're preparing for exams, working on homework, writing essays, or analyzing study materials, Cheg provides intelligent tools to support your learning journey.\n\nDesigned with a clean and intuitive interface, Cheg helps students stay productive while encouraging independent learning and critical thinking.\n\nKey Features\n\nAI Homework Help\nAsk academic questions and receive clear, step-by-step explanations to help you better understand topics across a wide range of subjects.\n\nEssay Writer\nGenerate well-structured essay drafts, outlines, introductions, conclusions, and ideas to support your writing process.\n\nPDF Analyzer\nUpload study materials, notes, or documents and receive concise summaries, explanations, and answers based on the content.\n\nQuiz Generator\nTurn your notes or documents into practice quizzes to reinforce learning and prepare for tests.\n\nCitation Generator\nCreate properly formatted citations for academic writing using commonly accepted citation styles.\n\nPlagiarism Checker\nReview your writing for potential originality concerns and receive helpful feedback before submitting your work.\n\nWhy Choose Cheg?\n• Fast and intuitive user experience\u2028\n• AI-powered learning assistance\n• Clean and distraction-free interface\u2028\n• Helpful for homework, assignments, and exam preparation\u2028\n• Supports essay writing and academic research\u2028\n• Practice with AI-generated quizzes\u2028\n• Analyze PDFs with ease\u2028\n• Generate citations for academic work\u2028\n• Regular updates with performance improvements and new features\n\nImportant Information\nCheg is designed as a learning assistant to help users study more effectively. AI-generated responses may occasionally contain inaccuracies or incomplete information. Users should carefully review, verify, and edit all generated content before relying on it for academic, professional, or personal purposes.\n\nPrivacy\nTo provide AI-powered features, the text, questions, or documents you choose to submit may be securely processed by our AI service provider. Only the information necessary to generate responses is processed. Please review our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use for more information about how your data is handled.\n\nCheg is an independent educational application and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any educational institution, examination board, publisher, or third-party learning platform.\n\nThank you for choosing Cheg. We're committed to continuously improving your learning experience with regular updates, performance enhancements, and new AI-powered study tools.\n\nImportant Links\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/zed-m/privacy-policy\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/zed-m/term-of-use", "trackCensoredName":"Cheg AI Study, Homework Helper", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cheg-ai-study-homework-helper/id6788892342?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":0, "minimumOsVersion":"17.6", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"11702272", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "sellerUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/zed-m/", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "genreIds":["6017"], "userRatingCount":0}, 
