"description":"Stufinder (also known as Stu Finder, StudioFinder, or Studio Finder) is an app for finding & booking recording studios. You can find a recording studio near you or list your studio and start earning.\n\nOur innovative technology simplifies booking & managing recording studios.\n\nStufinder is the No. 1 app to find & book recording studios! Book a recording studio on the Stufinder App now!\n\nThousands of studios in hundreds of cities. Stufinder, the go-to marketplace for recording studios.\n\nStufinder is a recording studio rental marketplace connecting those in need of studio time to studio owners.\n\nSTUDIOS ON STUFINDER:\nProfessional recording studios\nHome recording studios\nProject studios\nPodcast studios\nRehearsal studios\nMobile studios\n\n\nStufinder connects creators (artists/musicians, producers, podcasters, songwriters, audio engineers, & more), labels and managers looking for studio time to studio owners of one-of-a-kind recording studios available for bookings.\n\nStufinder makes it fast & easy for artists/musicians, producers, podcasters, audio engineers, record labels, & more to book studio sessions and rent studio time from studeurs (studio owners or managers).\n\nStufinder also makes it easy for studeurs (studio owners or managers) to earn money and more bookings for their recording studios.\n\n\nFOR CREATORS:\n\n1. Find a Studio\nDiscover plenty of recording studios on the Stufinder App\n\n2. Choose Day & Time\nChoose the day and times you want to start your session.\n\n3. Book & Pay\nBook on the Stufinder app and say hello to your Studeur!\n\n\nFOR STUDIO OWNERS (STUDEURS):\n\n1. List your Studio\nSet your availability, price and more.\n\n2. Connect & Manage\nManage your studio and review booking requests.\n\n3. Collect\nWatch your funds and bank account grow.\n\nDownload the app and start booking or earning today!", "trackCensoredName":"Stufinder", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stufinder/id1660865622?uo=4", "cont